sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Authenticated client
    participant G as Gateway / dashboard
    participant Q as Audited durable queue
    participant T as Bounded operational trace
    participant V as Authorized viewer
    C->>G: Request (new server UUID / validated correlation)
    G->>G: Authenticate current identity and grants
    G->>Q: Atomic acceptance with immutable origin IDs
    Q-->>G: Durable receipt (pending, not applied)
    G-->>C: HTTP result + request UUID
    G->>T: Bounded metadata only (best effort)
    Note over G,T: Failure never changes committed outcome; fixed degraded diagnostic
    V->>T: Current-authority filters/keyset page
    T-->>V: Scoped metadata and next cursor
    V->>Q: Authorized current job projection
    Q-->>V: Pending / success / refusal / retry / cancelled
